  "title": "Vegan Chocolate Almond Butter Cookies",
  "description": "These vegan cookies made with almond butter and chunks of dark chocolate are an everyday sweet treat that can double as a Christmas gift.",
  "authors": [
    "Karlaaaaa"
  ],
